  <file id="AtomUIGallery.Localization.TagShowCaseLangResourceKind">
    <unit id="ApiEventClosed">
      <segment>
        <source>Raised when the close action is clicked.</source>
        <target state="translated">点击关闭操作时触发。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="BasicDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Usage of basic Tag, and it could be IsClosable and customize close button by set closeIcon property,will display default close button when closeIcon is setting to true. IsClosable Tag supports onClose events.</source>
        <target state="translated">基础 Tag 用法。可通过 IsClosable 设置为可关闭，并通过 closeIcon 属性自定义关闭按钮；closeIcon 设置为 true 时显示默认关闭按钮。IsClosable Tag 支持 onClose 事件。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="BasicTitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Basic</source>
        <target state="translated">基础用法</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="CheckableTagDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>CheckableTag works like Checkbox. CheckableTagGroup provides single and multiple selection over a shared option set.</source>
        <target state="translated">CheckableTag 提供类似 Checkbox 的切换效果，CheckableTagGroup 可在同组选项上进行单选或多选。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="CheckableTagTitle">
